Indian brooding prince in royal robes in dhoti, angavastram and gold armlets, watching two brothers train, oil painting in the style of Raja Ravi Varma, rich pigments, soft chiaroscuro, reverent, ancient Puranic-era palace courtyard at dusk of low carved-stone and timber buildings, clay-tile roofs, cold blue shadows, wide horizontal composition with the subject left of centre and open space on the right, a purely visual image, every surface plain and unmarked.